 e visualizzate sui relativi display HEX;\nla posizione della virgola decimale, rappresentata mediante 4 bit, che attraverso un decoder viene indirizzata al display corrispondente.\n\nLe cifre BCD pari a 0 non vengono visualizzate quando tutte le cifre alla loro sinistra sono anch’esse pari a 0 e non è presente una virgola decimale alla loro destra.","direction":"RIGHT","labelDirection":"LEFT","propagationDelay":10,"customData":{"constructorParamaters":["Rappresentazione dell’output sul display\n\nIl circuito riceve in ingresso:\n\n10 cifre decimali in formato BCD, che vengono convertite e visualizzate sui relativi display HEX;\nla posizione della virgola decimale, rappresentata mediante 4 bit, che attraverso un decoder viene indirizzata al display corrispondente.\n\nLe cifre BCD pari a 0 non vengono visualizzate quando tutte le cifre alla loro sinistra sono anch’esse pari a 0 e non è presente una virgola decimale alla loro destra.",14]}},{"x":1270,"y":-210,"objectType":"Text","label":"Output representation on the display\n\nThe circuit receives the following inputs:\n\n10 decimal digits in BCD format, which are converted and displayed on the corresponding HEX displays;\nthe decimal-point position, represented by 4 bits, which are routed through a decoder to the corresponding display.\n\nBCD digits equal to 0 are not displayed when all digits to their left are also equal to 0 and there is no decimal point immediately to their right.","direction":"RIGHT","labelDirection":"LEFT","propagationDelay":10,"customData":{"constructorParamaters":["Output representation on the display\n\nThe circuit receives the following inputs:\n\n10 decimal digits in BCD format, which are converted and displayed on the corresponding HEX displays;\nthe decimal-point position, represented by 4 bits, which are routed through a decoder to the corresponding display.\n\nBCD digits equal to 0 are not displayed when all digits to their left are also equal to 0 and there is no decimal point immediately to their right.",14]}}],"restrictedCircuitElementsUsed":[],"nodes":[92,93,94,95,96,115,116,117,118,119,120,121,122,123,124,125,126,127,128,129,130,131,132,133,138,139,143,144,148,149,150,151,155,156,157,158,159,163,164,168,169,170,171,172,173,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,187,188,189,190,191,192,196,197,198,201,203,211,214,215,218,220,222,224,226,228,230,232,234,236,238,240,242,244,246,255,256,257,258,259,260,269,270,271,280,281,282,291,292,293,294,303,304,305,306,315,316,317,326,327,336,337,338,339,348,349,350,351,352]},{"layout":{"width":100,"height":200,"title_x":50,"title_y":13,"titleEnabled":true},"verilogMetadata":{"isVerilogCircuit":false,"isMainCircuit":false,"code":"// Write Some Verilog Code Here!","subCircuitScopeIds":[]},"allNodes":[{"x":100,"y":20,"type":1,"bitWidth":32,"label":"","connections":[30]},{"x":100,"y":60,"type":1,"bitWidth":1,"label":"","connections":[]},{"x":0,"y":20,"type":0,"bitWidth":32,"label":"","connections":[5]},{"x":0,"y":40,"type":0,"bitWidth":32,"label":"","connections":[10]},{"x":10,"y":0,"type":1,"bitWidth":32,"label":"","connections":[10]},{"x":-10,"y":10,"type":0,"bitWidth":32,"label":"","connections":[2]},{"x":20,"y":-20,"type":0,"bitWidth":4,"label":"","connections":[9]},{"x":20,"y":0,"type":0,"bitWidth":28,"label":"","connections":[44]},{"x":10,"y":0,"type":1,"bitWidth":28,"label":"","connections":[47]},{"x":40,"y":0,"type":1,"bitWidth":4,"label":"","connections":[6]},{"x":210,"y":210,"type":2,"bitWidth":32,"label":"","connections":[3,4]},{"x":100,"y":20,"type":1,"bitWidth":32,"label":"","connections":[28]},{"x":100,"y":60,"type":1,"bitWidth":1,"label":"","connections":[]},{"x":0,"y":20,"type":0,"bitWidth":32,"label":"","connections":[16]},{"x":0,"y":40,"type":0,"bitWidth":32,"label":"","connections":[22]},{"x":10,"y":0,"type":1,"bitWidth":4,"label":"","connections":[19]},{"x":-10,"y":10,"type":0,"bitWidth":32,"label":"","connections":[13]},{"x":20,"y":-20,"type":0,"bitWidth":4,"label":"","connections":[19]},{"x":20,"y":0